type: software
title: "medrecsim"
abstract: >-
  A fully synthetic, client-only medication-reconciliation simulation for junior residents and
  senior medical students. Pre-release; under active construction; not validated for learning
  outcomes. Educational use only; not medical advice. All content is fictional and synthetic.
